From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:07:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove mock product/review data so only the real
 backend-integrated product shows
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Delete fake product catalog and fake reviews from data/mock-products.ts
  (kept categories, categoryMeta, useCases, shopByNeedIcons, mockEvents,
  mockJournalPosts -- legitimate static config / unrelated content types
  with no backend yet).
- Split app/page.tsx into a Server Component (fetches getAllProducts()
  from Supabase) + components/home/home-content.tsx client component,
  matching the existing Server-fetches/Client-renders pattern.
- Mood-picker grid no longer silently pads in fake products when a mood
  has no real matches -- shows an honest empty state instead.
- Removed a hardcoded fake star rating (4.8/4.9) shown on every product
  card with no real data behind it.
- Reviews page now shows a real empty state instead of mock reviews,
  since no reviews table exists yet.

🤖 Generated with Claude
